You might make that recommendation, but it's really rather useless. 
All that really matters is that you are dipping one non-artifact long
sword, Excalibur doesn't already exist in the game, your experience
level is at least 5 and that you are lawful.  If a hand appears for
non-lawfuls, the sword is cursed, 2/3 of the time the enchantment is
decreased by 1 (unless it's already at -6 or worse), the rustproofing
is removed and your wisdom is abused.

